---
name: alert
type: registry:ui
title: Alert
description: Displays a callout for user attention with optional title, description, and action.
dependencies:
  - tailwind-variants
files:
  - path: registry/items/components/alert/alert.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: "~/components/alert/alert.svelte"
  - path: registry/items/components/alert/alert-title.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: "~/components/alert/alert-title.svelte"
  - path: registry/items/components/alert/alert-description.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: "~/components/alert/alert-description.svelte"
  - path: registry/items/components/alert/alert-action.svelte
    type: registry:ui
    target: "~/components/alert/alert-action.svelte"
  - path: registry/items/components/alert/alert.variants.ts
    type: registry:ui
    target: "~/components/alert/alert.variants.ts"
  - path: registry/items/components/alert/index.ts
    type: registry:ui
    target: "~/components/alert/index.ts"
---

Use alerts for status messages, warnings, and important callouts.

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
  import CheckCircle2Icon from "@lucide/svelte/icons/check-circle-2";
  import * as Alert from "~/components/alert";
</script>

<Alert.Root>
  <CheckCircle2Icon />
  <Alert.Title>Success! Your changes have been saved</Alert.Title>
  <Alert.Description>This is an alert with icon, title and description.</Alert.Description>
</Alert.Root>
```

Pass `variant="destructive"` for error-style callouts. Compose an icon as a direct child of `Alert.Root` for a leading indicator, and use `Alert.Action` for a corner action.
